      "status": "sent",
      "body": "Entry 1121 closes the algebraic support test for the corrected quadratic Kummer line. Its canonical generator is k=(-(s+7)/4,1,0,0) in (Omega111,Omega101,Omega110,e5). Under Entry 851's frozen stacked residues it maps to ((s+7)/4,-1,-(s+7)/4,0) in (t1,g1,t2,g2), nonzero rank1 on s^2+6s+1=0, and Res_top=(1,0,1,0) kills it exactly. Thus the unique anti-invariant line is already a coherent existing-wall Cousin class. Remaining question is physical-chain pairing only; no carrier modification is indicated.",
